Symin is now the teacher of the [[Hateno School]]. He was recruited by [[Princess Zelda|Zelda]] because of his experience dealing with children from being Purah's assistant.<ref>{{Cite|I've recruited Symin from the research institute to teach there. He was Purah's assistant for years, which makes him well-equipped to deal with the needs of quirky children.|Zelda's Journal|TotK}}</ref> He gives Link the "[[Teach Me a Lesson I]]" and "[[Teach Me a Lesson II]]" [[Side Quest]]s.

==Nomenclature==
Symin's name comes from the fruit persimmon.
